            "review_title": "Review at Western Home Cooked Meals",
            "review_text": "Laura\n1 contribution\n0\nNice staff with a cute doggie\nOct 2022\nFor a dog-lover this is the place to visit, they have a cute little chihuahua in the restaurant you can play with. Staff here is very caring and genuine, and they make really good quality food for a good price. The owner also is very passionate about her job and cares about her customers, and doesn't mind sharing her knowledge and thoughts on how to travel in Ho Chi Minh⭐\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 27, 2022",
